# Deny-all with an allowlist that mirrors exactly what executor-image/Dockerfile
# copies. An ignore-list would silently grow stale as the repository does: the
# build context was 7.1 GB, almost all of it `.claude/worktree` checkouts and
# `node_modules` that the image rebuilds from the lockfile anyway, and it also
# carried `.env` to the daemon even though no COPY references it.
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!tsconfig.json
!src
!scripts
!executor-image
